    "name":  "Linear LED Pendant \u0026 Surface Lamp 50W | POLARIS | Linear Interconnection | 3CCT | 150cm",
    "reference":  "LN50W-3CCT-92088",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLinear LED Pendant Lamp 50W POLARIS 150CM - CCT Selectable Color Temperature -\u003c/strong\u003e the ideal solution for elegant and efficient lighting. Its innovative \u003cstrong\u003einterconnectable design\u003c/strong\u003e allows connecting multiple lamps \u003cstrong\u003ein line\u003c/strong\u003e without additional accessories, giving you a flexible installation without complications.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIncludes everything needed to mount it suspended.\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eThe fixture ends allow continuous light passage\u003c/strong\u003e, creating a sophisticated visual effect. Perfect for modern and professional spaces requiring high-impact lighting with easy installation.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eLinear LED Pendant Lamp 50W | POLARIS | Linear Interconnection | 3CCT | 150cm\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTransform your spaces with the \u003cstrong\u003ePOLARIS 50W 150CM Linear LED Pendant Lamp\u003c/strong\u003e, the ultimate elegant efficient versatile lighting solution.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eKey Features:\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Selectable CCT Color Temperature:\u003c/strong\u003e 3000K, 4500K, 6000K\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Continuous Linear Interconnectable Design:\u003c/strong\u003e Connect multiple units in line without additional accessories\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- No Accessories Needed:\u003c/strong\u003e Direct connection between battens\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Continuous Visual Effect:\u003c/strong\u003e Light passes through batten ends\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Lifud No Flick Driver:\u003c/strong\u003e Flicker-free\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- High-Impact Lighting:\u003c/strong\u003e 50W\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eUses: Modern professional environments, commercial spaces, exhibition areas, residential.\u003c/h3\u003e",
